# Before: a container without a zone class keeps d2's 28px title over the 16px node labels.
...@neutral-theme
direction: right
client: Client app {class: actor}
svc: Services {
  label.near: top-left
  orders: Orders {class: [service; focal]}
  billing: Billing {class: service}
}
client -> svc.orders: {class: flow}
client -> svc.billing: {class: dep}
